    "text": "This data item records the grade of a solid primary tumor before any treatment (surgical resection or initiation of any treatment including neoadjuvant). For cases diagnosed January 1, 2018 and later, this data item, along with Grade Pathological [3844] and Grade Post-Therapy [3845], replaces Grade/Differentiation [440] as well as SSF's for cancer sites with alternative grading systems (e.g., breast [Bloom-Richardson], prostate [Gleason]).",
